    "title": "Cause of Kansas train derailment under investigation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago KIOWA COOUNTY —Authorities are cleaning up after a train derailment in Kiowa County. Just before 8a.m. Thursday, approximately 39 rail cars on a Union Pacific train derailed near Highway 54 and 25th Avenue in Greensburg, according to a Jill Micek with Union Pacific. No one was hurt and there were no hazardous releases. Cleanup is underway and the cause is under investigation. Read full article",
